@base_url = http://localhost:8080/api/listings

### happy path: create a need
POST  {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 10,
  "quantityRemaining": 10,
  "urgency": "HIGH",
  "neededBy": "2026-09-01",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Happy path: Create a SURPLUS
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "SURPLUS",
  "quantity": 100,
  "quantityRemaining": 100,
  "availableUntil": "2026-09-10",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

